@gw = http://localhost:8090

### 1. Login (sin token)
# @name login
POST {{gw}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

### 2. Usuarios con token
GET {{gw}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 3. Posts con token
GET {{gw}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 4. Sin token → 401
GET {{gw}}/api/users

### 5. Credenciales inválidas → 401
POST {{gw}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "incorrecta" }
